She continues to take atorvastatin 40 mg daily, which has helped in maintaining controlled cholesterol levels, a crucial factor in preventing further cardiovascular events.\n\nJuly 18, 2024 - Rash\n\nBP: 122/79 mmHg\nWeight: 116 lbs\n\nThe patient presented on July 18, 2024, with a rash. Her blood pressure was 122/79 mmHg, and her weight was lbs. The rash was evaluated, and appropriate treatment was recommended. She did not report any associated systemic symptoms, and the rash resolved without further complication.\n\nNovember 20, 2023 - Stroke (CVA)\n\nBP: 124/78 mmHg\nWeight: 117 lbs\n\nOn November 20, 2023, Ms"
